{
  "id": 407355646,
  "iid": 20893,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Add HTTP/3 quic stream id field.",
  "description": "It is currently impossible to do proper connection tracking outside of wireshark. The problem is subtle:\n - A single UDP packet can have data from multiple QUIC stream ids\n - A single QUIC stream can have multiple HTTP/3 frames in it\n - With the current layout, it is impossible to tell which QUIC stream belongs to which HTTP/3 frame in a single packet.\n\nThis adds http3.frame_streamid that contains the QUIC stream id for each HTTP/3 frame.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-08-14T16:53:04.520Z",
